requirements refunds v1
description "A test material: a shop's refunds, met by a policy of its gate and checked by an expectation of it"

role payments "Decides how refunds go"

requirement clerks_refund
  text "A clerk who is not suspended refunds an order"
  owner payments
  decided 2026-10-06 by payments "Clerks answer the customers who ask for their money back"
  satisfied by sekisho "refunds.gate" policy clerks_refund
  verified by sekisho "refunds.gate" expect clerks_who_are_not_suspended_refund
